#ASSERT `liable to a penalty under s 10` FALSE TRUE FALSE (Date 1 7 2024)
#ASSERT `liable to a penalty under s 10` FALSE FALSE TRUE (Date 1 7 2024)
#ASSERT NOT `liable to a penalty under s 10` FALSE FALSE FALSE (Date 1 7 2024)
