§§ `Goal 3 — recovery (ss 11, 11AA, 11A)`

#ASSERT `s 11 applies` FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `s 11 applies` FALSE FALSE
-- s 11(3): acceptance of the lower rate, or an agreement, does not bar recovery
#ASSERT `may recover the wages under s 11` `the worker` `, s 11 applies:` TRUE `, accepted:` TRUE `, agreed otherwise:` TRUE `, conduct on` `a day in 2024`
#ASSERT `may recover the wages under s 11` `a Labour Inspector` `, s 11 applies:` TRUE `, accepted:` FALSE `, agreed otherwise:` FALSE `, conduct on` `a day in 2024`
#ASSERT NOT `may recover the wages under s 11` `another person` `, s 11 applies:` TRUE `, accepted:` FALSE `, agreed otherwise:` FALSE `, conduct on` `a day in 2024`
#ASSERT NOT `may recover the wages under s 11` `the worker` `, s 11 applies:` FALSE `, accepted:` FALSE `, agreed otherwise:` FALSE `, conduct on` `a day in 2024`

GIVEN leave IS A BOOLEAN, employer IS A BOOLEAN, `can pay` IS A NUMBER, d IS A DATE
GIVETH AN `Arrears claim against a person involved`
`a claim against a director` leave employer `can pay` d MEANS
    `Arrears claim against a person involved` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, employer, leave, 1000, `can pay`, d

-- s 11AA(2)(b): only to the extent the employer cannot pay
